{"version":1,"key":"card:549","content":{"id":549,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们都知道作用域的概念，它是指变量可访问范围。我们自然而然的会提出一个疑问，它是如何工作的，JavaScript 是如何判断变量是否可以访问的？对于嵌套场景下同名变量引用的值是如何区分的？答案是词法环境，JavaScript 引擎内部通过词法环境来跟踪和管理变量。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"每次创建执行上下文时，都会创建变量环境和词法环境，变量环境和词法环境具有相同的数据结构，不过存储的是不同类型的变量，变量环境中存储的是 "},{"type":"content-link","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"var"}],"refId":503,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":428},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量和声明在全局上下文顶层或函数顶层的函数，而词法环境存储的是 "},{"type":"content-link","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"let"}],"refId":505,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":429},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"content-link","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"const"}],"refId":507,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":430},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的变量、声明在非顶层的函数和类声明。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在创建新的"},{"type":"content-link","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"执行上下文"}],"refId":548,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":1349},{"type":"formatted","text":"时，变量环境和词法环境都是一样的，如果创建了新的词法环境，词法环境会进行切换，而变量环境保持不变，所以在一个执行上下文中只有一个变量环境，但是可能存在多个词法环境。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量环境是为了兼容 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"var","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明变量的历史包袱，我觉得可以理解为变量环境和执行上下文顶层的词法环境是一样的，甚至可以看作是一个东西，这样就没有变量环境的概念了，也更容易理解。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"二者的数据结构如下："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"LexicalEnvironment = {\n  EnvironmentRecord: { \n    // 当前环境的变量存储\n  },\n  [[OuterEnv]]: <父级词法环境的引用>\n}","language":"C++","uuid":"f512571a-e1c7-4384-b42a-b8fcd1095409","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中包含两个部分："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[[OuterEnv]]","code":true},{"text":"，外部词法环境引用，指向父级词法环境","type":"formatted"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"EnvironmentRecord","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当前词法环境的变量存储"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在执行上下文的创建阶段，就通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[[OuterEnv]]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 建立好了作用域链，在执行阶段当我们访问变量时，首先会查看当前所在的词法环境中是否存在该变量，如果不存在，那么就根据 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[[OuterEnv]]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 存储的父词法环境中去寻找，以此类推，直到最外层的全局执行上下文中的词法环境，这个查询的链路就是变量的作用域链。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"什么情况下会产生新的词法环境："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"全局环境"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数调用"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"块级作用域("},{"type":"formatted","text":"{}","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":")并且使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"let","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明了变量"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"模块"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"eval","code":true}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"catch","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 子句，不同于块级作用域，无论如何都会显式创建一个词法作用域，用于存储异常变量"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用词法环境解释一个例子"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"for (var i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n   console.log(i); \n  })\n}","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"cbdff044-11dd-402c-b4e8-9540bedf749b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"var","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"i","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"i","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 存储在变量环境中，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"setTimeout","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中访问 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"i","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时会查找到变量环境中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"i","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当循环执行完成时，变量环境中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"i","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"5","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，因此会打印五个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"5","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"5\n5\n5\n5\n5","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0538b21b-fa91-45eb-9267-30c1ba0bbb41","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n   console.log(i); \n  })\n}","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"6a1613f0-48ed-42ff-b66d-d9563a46742d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"let","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"i","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，每次循环迭代时都会创建一个词法环境，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"setTimeout","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 访问的是所处词法环境中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"i","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，循环结束后，创建了五个词法环境，其中的 i 分别是当时的快照"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"0\n1\n2\n3\n4","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"4b1497e0-6b92-4239-831e-d53f2b8774b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/作用域","JavaScript/词法环境","JavaScript/底层原理"],"createTime":1743683575326,"updateTime":1752403927638,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752403927638},"links":{"card:503":{"key":"card:503","type":"card","id":503},"card:505":{"key":"card:505","type":"card","id":505},"card:507":{"key":"card:507","type":"card","id":507},"card:548":{"key":"card:548","type":"card","id":548}}}